WEBVTT

00:52.802 --> 00:55.722
Master. It is me, Yeom.

00:55.805 --> 00:58.933
You have been meditating
for 100 days as of yesterday.

00:59.017 --> 01:00.310
It is time that you go outside.

01:05.982 --> 01:07.108
Master.

01:12.697 --> 01:13.948
Master.

01:17.702 --> 01:18.745
Master…

01:19.871 --> 01:20.789
Master.

01:22.957 --> 01:23.875
Master!

01:24.709 --> 01:25.794
Master…

01:27.670 --> 01:28.588
Master!

01:34.552 --> 01:37.555
- Oh, dear. Poor boy.
- Poor thing.

01:37.639 --> 01:40.099
- Goodness gracious.
- Unbelievable.

01:40.183 --> 01:42.811
- He must have frozen to death.
- It seems like it.

01:42.894 --> 01:45.647
- I feel so sorry for him.
- Poor child.

01:45.730 --> 01:46.940
- Oh, gosh.
- My goodness.

01:47.023 --> 01:48.691
What is going on? What is it?

01:48.775 --> 01:50.944
Oh, dear! The homeless boy has died.

01:51.027 --> 01:53.613
He was just a young boy.
I feel so bad for him.

01:53.696 --> 01:56.741
My goodness, that poor thing.

02:18.513 --> 02:21.099
Master, as you have always wished,

02:22.350 --> 02:25.353
I will give you a quiet farewell.

02:32.819 --> 02:34.988
Goodness, I feel so bad for him.

02:35.697 --> 02:37.740
He seems like an orphan.

02:37.824 --> 02:39.325
Let us hold a funeral for him.

02:39.409 --> 02:40.577
- Yes.
- Let us do that.

02:40.660 --> 02:41.703
Should we cremate him

02:41.786 --> 02:43.955
and sprinkle the ashes
by Lake Gyeongcheondaeho?

02:44.038 --> 02:45.415
- Oh, my goodness!
- My gosh!

02:45.498 --> 02:46.958
Child…

02:47.041 --> 02:48.001
Are you all right?

02:50.628 --> 02:52.505
- What in the world…
- How…

02:52.589 --> 02:55.633
- Where is he going?
- Where are you going?

03:03.850 --> 03:05.351
Stop!

03:16.696 --> 03:17.780
Child.

03:17.864 --> 03:20.199
Did you just tell me to stop?

03:22.327 --> 03:23.453
How foolish of you.

03:24.120 --> 03:26.623
I cannot believe that
you have already burned my body.

03:29.167 --> 03:31.169
What are you talking about?

03:33.171 --> 03:36.591
Had I been a little late,
you would have burned my cane too.

03:37.717 --> 03:39.260
You fool!

03:41.971 --> 03:43.139
You fool!

03:43.765 --> 03:46.434
You fool!

03:47.477 --> 03:49.520
You fool.

03:56.444 --> 03:57.946
Master?

03:58.029 --> 04:00.490
I only temporarily
shifted my soul out of my body

04:00.573 --> 04:02.367
to test if I had reached Hwansu

04:02.450 --> 04:04.827
after my 100 days of meditating.

04:05.411 --> 04:09.207
But I noticed that my body was burning,
so I quickly entered another body.

04:10.291 --> 04:11.501
But it is too late.

04:14.045 --> 04:17.840
Are you saying
you are in this child's body?

04:17.924 --> 04:20.134
Is it really you, Master?

04:20.718 --> 04:21.552
That is right.

04:21.636 --> 04:24.639
I am Lee Cheol, your master.

04:25.223 --> 04:26.057
My goodness…

04:27.934 --> 04:29.560
Master.

04:30.812 --> 04:31.813
Master.

04:42.699 --> 04:44.951
I am a soul shifter.

04:55.211 --> 04:56.296
Your Majesty.

04:56.796 --> 05:00.633
Did you not summon me today
to find the soul shifter?

05:01.259 --> 05:02.510
I will do just that.

05:03.303 --> 05:04.387
I can

05:04.470 --> 05:06.389
recognize soul shifters.

05:40.757 --> 05:42.884
Is there anyone else
who has seen your face?

05:47.346 --> 05:48.347
This is an umbrella.

05:49.432 --> 05:50.933
You can use this as a cane.

05:53.686 --> 05:54.687
No.

05:54.771 --> 05:58.024
No one else in the capital knows
that I am not blind.

05:59.192 --> 06:02.236
People will think of this
as a fight between thugs.

06:10.787 --> 06:12.747
You should have stopped searching for me.

06:17.627 --> 06:18.586
So-i.

06:21.839 --> 06:23.424
So-i, is that you?

06:23.508 --> 06:25.051
I am Kim from Sari Village.

06:26.344 --> 06:27.553
You have the wrong person.

06:35.144 --> 06:37.980
We rarely ever talked to each other.
He barely knows me.

06:38.064 --> 06:39.107
That man

06:39.732 --> 06:41.150
must be taken care of.

06:52.829 --> 06:54.872
There was no need to kill him.

06:54.956 --> 06:57.500
Once he left for Sari Village,
we would have never met again.

06:57.583 --> 06:58.668
But you did meet.

07:00.586 --> 07:01.671
Sari Village?

07:04.340 --> 07:05.883
Is that where you used to stay?

07:09.011 --> 07:10.179
I lived there to hide.

07:11.180 --> 07:14.392
I lived there for a while
to hide from those thugs.

07:16.060 --> 07:19.689
Is there anyone else from Sari Village
who might recognize you?

07:20.690 --> 07:23.734
I always kept a distance
so that no one would easily recognize me.

07:24.944 --> 07:26.487
I was a thief there too, you see.

07:26.571 --> 07:28.239
- What is that?
- Money.

07:28.322 --> 07:31.492
It would seem peculiar
if no one took his money after he died.

07:32.952 --> 07:34.162
You can keep it.

07:48.801 --> 07:51.262
I did not want to harm anyone
from Sari Village.

08:03.774 --> 08:05.526
Mu-deok is in the capital.

08:05.610 --> 08:07.987
If I ever run into her,
will I have to kill her too?

08:10.948 --> 08:13.201
Is Broker Kim from Sari Village here?

08:13.784 --> 08:15.786
Yes, he just arrived.

08:15.870 --> 08:17.914
He is in the last room
on the second floor.

08:48.986 --> 08:49.987
Young Lady Jin?

08:57.620 --> 09:01.707
What brings you to a place like this?

09:01.791 --> 09:04.252
It is none of your business.
You did not see me here.

09:05.461 --> 09:06.837
Young Lady Jin, by any chance…

09:09.465 --> 09:10.508
Do you gamble?

09:10.591 --> 09:12.468
What? Gamble?

09:13.135 --> 09:16.097
What do you take me for?
Do I seem that vulgar to you?

09:16.180 --> 09:17.723
No, of course not.

09:18.724 --> 09:21.519
But you lied and told me
the jade was not broken when it was.

09:21.602 --> 09:25.523
Given you are capable of lying
without feeling the least bit of guilt,

09:26.148 --> 09:28.192
I thought you would have
a knack for gambling.

09:32.530 --> 09:34.240
I came to buy tickets from a scalper.

09:35.408 --> 09:37.326
The tickets to a magic show were sold out.

09:37.410 --> 09:38.744
That is why I am here.

09:38.828 --> 09:40.788
ADMISSION TICKET
SEOCHUN MAGICIANS

09:41.706 --> 09:44.500
- You got two tickets.
- I am going with my mother.

09:44.584 --> 09:46.335
Do not tell anyone you saw me here.

09:46.419 --> 09:48.796
I do not wish to cause
any misunderstandings.

09:48.879 --> 09:50.172
I cannot guarantee that.

09:50.256 --> 09:52.800
I am not as good of a liar
as you are, you see.

09:52.883 --> 09:55.428
So if someone asks,
I am not sure if I can lie.

09:56.762 --> 09:59.640
But I will try my best for your sake.

10:04.353 --> 10:06.147
Why did I have to run into her here?

10:19.327 --> 10:20.995
What is the leader of Songrim doing here?

10:24.332 --> 10:28.294
I hope he is not here
to get tickets to the magic show.

10:30.421 --> 10:33.257
If he goes, I will not be able to go
with Young Master Park.

11:14.215 --> 11:15.508
You must be the one

11:16.634 --> 11:18.177
who killed him.

11:20.012 --> 11:21.222
It was not me.

11:21.972 --> 11:23.516
Why did you kill him?

11:23.599 --> 11:24.975
It really was not me.

11:25.059 --> 11:27.019
He was already dead when I came here.

11:32.024 --> 11:33.526
He was killed not too long ago.

11:34.276 --> 11:35.361
It was done in a single stroke.

11:36.570 --> 11:37.947
Whoever did this is a skilled swordsman.

11:38.614 --> 11:41.075
I swear it was not me.

11:41.951 --> 11:43.869
I do not even have a sword.

12:04.849 --> 12:06.809
I think they were killed
by the same person.

12:08.102 --> 12:09.395
Who are these men?

12:09.478 --> 12:14.442
They were a group of thugs
who recently entered the capital.

12:14.525 --> 12:16.527
Did they come with Broker Kim

12:16.610 --> 12:20.573
who came from Sari Village?

12:20.656 --> 12:21.949
No.

12:22.032 --> 12:26.579
But I remember these thugs
picking a fight with him a few days ago.

12:28.080 --> 12:32.960
They wanted to know the whereabouts
of a female swindler from Sari Village.

12:33.043 --> 12:34.628
A swindler from Sari Village?

12:34.712 --> 12:36.505
Could that be Mu-deok?

12:38.507 --> 12:40.759
Where is she?

12:45.473 --> 12:47.141
She was right behind me.

12:49.685 --> 12:50.978
She ran away.

13:01.614 --> 13:02.823
What is going on?

13:03.824 --> 13:05.409
What were all those bodies?

13:06.243 --> 13:10.831
They wanted to know the whereabouts
of a female swindler from Sari Village.

13:11.790 --> 13:13.167
Could that really be me?

13:14.293 --> 13:17.338
What kind of life has Mu-deok led?

13:17.922 --> 13:20.549
Did you meet with So-i?

13:20.633 --> 13:22.801
I wonder what she did this time.

13:22.885 --> 13:24.678
Do not get involved with her.

13:26.847 --> 13:27.890
So-i…

13:29.683 --> 13:31.101
Who is So-i?

13:34.021 --> 13:36.148
I did not see the girl
who came to see you.

13:36.857 --> 13:39.944
But she quarreled with the guards
and even slapped one of them.

13:40.027 --> 13:41.946
So I am sure the guards
would remember her face.

13:42.863 --> 13:46.033
Madam, neither of those guards
came to work today.

13:46.116 --> 13:48.160
- They both did not come?
- No.

13:48.244 --> 13:50.746
How strange. They never miss work.

13:56.544 --> 13:59.255
We are sorry.
How we acted was no way to treat a mage.

13:59.755 --> 14:02.383
But is this really necessary?

14:02.466 --> 14:03.884
"Mage"?

14:03.968 --> 14:05.386
You even lied that you were a mage?

14:06.887 --> 14:08.097
I will soon become one.

14:08.681 --> 14:12.685
One who is far more prestigious
than the likes of you.

14:15.062 --> 14:18.482
How dare you talk down to me
when you are nothing but a fake?

14:18.983 --> 14:20.985
I will continue to talk down to you

14:21.944 --> 14:24.780
while you speak to me with respect.
That is how things will be.

14:31.745 --> 14:33.247
Go after him.

14:33.330 --> 14:34.748
That is your job.

14:41.672 --> 14:45.092
Is there a girl named Mu-deok
from Sari Village at Chwiseonru?

14:45.175 --> 14:48.512
Yes, I know her. Was she the person
you were looking for that night?

14:49.471 --> 14:52.641
I had to ask her for a favor
and return something to her.

14:52.725 --> 14:54.768
Mu-deok is not at Chwiseonru.

14:54.852 --> 14:58.022
She works as a maid for the Jang family,
the family of Cheonbugwan's Gwanju.

14:58.689 --> 15:00.065
She is working as a maid?

15:01.358 --> 15:03.319
I guess she really can see now.

15:04.194 --> 15:06.280
She must have fooled you too.

15:06.363 --> 15:08.032
We brought her to Chwiseonru
thinking she was blind,

15:08.115 --> 15:10.534
but we were shocked
when she opened her eyes and ran.

15:12.119 --> 15:14.121
But she is not a swindler like I am.

15:15.247 --> 15:16.749
How is she able to see?

15:20.461 --> 15:22.254
Please do not kill me.

15:23.172 --> 15:24.381
I am sorry.

15:24.965 --> 15:27.176
You know my face,
so I cannot let you live.

15:28.385 --> 15:29.595
Please…

15:53.744 --> 15:57.289
If she was always able to see,
that means she might recognize me.

15:59.667 --> 16:01.585
She works as a maid for the Jang family?

16:03.379 --> 16:04.922
I should pay her a visit.

16:07.508 --> 16:09.301
Mu-deok committed murder?

16:09.885 --> 16:13.055
Several men died at the ferry inn,

16:13.138 --> 16:15.808
and Mu-deok was there.

16:15.891 --> 16:19.645
But Mu-deok is not strong enough
to kill someone.

16:19.728 --> 16:21.605
Especially not enough to kill several men.

16:21.689 --> 16:23.899
It was done by a skilled swordsman.

16:24.483 --> 16:25.901
If it was not her,

16:26.568 --> 16:28.612
she likely received help from a mage.

16:30.114 --> 16:31.281
Do not tell me

16:32.032 --> 16:33.951
that you are suspecting Young Master Jang.

16:35.077 --> 16:36.328
I am not.

16:36.412 --> 16:39.873
Uk is currently at the palace
with Master Lee.

16:41.792 --> 16:43.377
Thank goodness.

16:43.460 --> 16:45.879
It could not have been Mu-deok.

16:45.963 --> 16:48.215
She has no reason to harm anyone.

16:48.298 --> 16:49.466
Maidservant Kim.

16:49.550 --> 16:52.928
How much do you know about Mu-deok?

16:54.513 --> 16:55.806
Do you know

16:55.889 --> 17:01.020
what kind of life she led
before she started working here?

17:03.063 --> 17:03.939
What?

17:04.023 --> 17:05.733
The man who died

17:05.816 --> 17:08.444
was someone I had met
to ask about Mu-deok's past.

17:10.154 --> 17:12.114
A group of thugs
who seemed to be looking for her

17:12.990 --> 17:14.616
was also killed.

17:17.494 --> 17:20.247
It was obvious that
she was bound to get suspected,

17:20.330 --> 17:22.875
but she ran away
instead of proving her innocence.

17:23.375 --> 17:24.501
One thing is for sure.

17:24.585 --> 17:29.214
Mu-deok is hiding something

17:29.298 --> 17:32.718
that must not be revealed.

17:42.770 --> 17:45.272
The guards live over there.

17:45.355 --> 17:47.191
But would it not be faster

17:47.274 --> 17:50.444
to just draw a sketch of her
and find her yourself?

17:50.527 --> 17:52.112
I do not know what she looks like.

17:52.196 --> 17:55.032
- I met her when I was blind.
- I thought you were never blind.

17:56.283 --> 18:00.329
One day, you say you were blind.
The next day, you say you were not.

18:01.538 --> 18:04.458
I do not know your reasons
but you live such a complicated life.

18:06.752 --> 18:10.005
So you do not know what she looks like,
but she knows you?

18:10.964 --> 18:13.175
Then would it not be dangerous
to look for her?

18:13.258 --> 18:15.969
What if she killed the broker
and those thugs?

18:16.053 --> 18:17.554
She might try to harm you too.

18:18.889 --> 18:21.725
It is more dangerous to be suspected
by the leader of Songrim.

18:24.603 --> 18:27.231
It will put you in trouble too
since you paid the broker.

18:27.314 --> 18:28.565
What do you mean?

18:29.566 --> 18:31.735
I do not know what you are talking about.

18:32.528 --> 18:33.570
Good.

18:34.446 --> 18:36.740
Just keep acting like
you do not know anything.

18:37.699 --> 18:39.326
Someone is dead!

18:58.887 --> 19:01.014
Guard Lee and Guard Jang are both dead.

19:09.064 --> 19:12.568
What Hwansu entails is truly impressive.

19:13.235 --> 19:16.864
I thought all soul shifters were monsters.

19:17.489 --> 19:19.575
But in your case,
you gained youth and eternal life.

19:21.118 --> 19:23.162
It is no wonder that

19:23.245 --> 19:25.873
everyone wanted the ice stone
for the alchemy of souls.

19:26.623 --> 19:29.418
Everyone coveted it,
which led to endless fights.

19:29.501 --> 19:31.295
And that is why it was banned.

19:31.378 --> 19:32.754
All right, Master Lee.

19:33.672 --> 19:35.591
You say you can recognize soul shifters.

19:35.674 --> 19:37.092
Take a look around.

19:37.634 --> 19:40.512
Are there any soul shifters
in this palace?

19:54.318 --> 19:57.196
I cannot tell just by looking at them.

19:57.279 --> 19:59.448
If they do not show their blue marks

19:59.531 --> 20:01.450
or run wild and get petrified,

20:01.533 --> 20:03.619
they look no different
from ordinary humans.

20:04.536 --> 20:07.331
Then how do you recognize them?

20:08.248 --> 20:10.209
The fear of getting caught.

20:12.294 --> 20:14.463
The horror of getting petrified.

20:18.675 --> 20:20.469
I must bring that out of them.

20:21.053 --> 20:23.847
So you recognize them by instilling fear?

20:23.931 --> 20:25.724
I apologize if I disappointed you.

20:26.308 --> 20:27.351
Instead,

20:28.644 --> 20:30.812
I will give you a gift, Your Majesty.

20:30.896 --> 20:32.940
A gift? What have you brought?

20:34.191 --> 20:35.359
A dog.

20:36.360 --> 20:37.319
A dog?

20:37.402 --> 20:40.072
He is a very clever and gentle dog.

20:40.155 --> 20:42.366
He should be in front
of the royal palace by now.

20:42.449 --> 20:44.493
May I bring him inside?

20:44.576 --> 20:46.703
You brought him as a gift, so of course.

20:47.496 --> 20:48.664
Bring him in.

20:49.581 --> 20:50.457
Uk.

20:51.166 --> 20:52.834
I want you to go and bring the dog.

20:54.878 --> 20:58.340
If you successfully bring him in,
I shall give you a reward.

21:28.620 --> 21:31.081
Should I just leave
and run away with Mu-deok?

21:32.666 --> 21:34.710
If I do that, everyone will find out.

21:35.752 --> 21:39.172
And right now, I am not strong enough
to protect my master.

21:44.177 --> 21:46.221
I wonder what Master Lee plans to do.

22:15.000 --> 22:16.209
Assistant Gwanju, sir.

22:17.252 --> 22:18.628
What is it?

22:22.132 --> 22:26.678
Fluffy is the gift that
Master Lee brought for His Majesty?

22:26.762 --> 22:30.474
Master Lee told me that
the dog will follow you inside.

22:31.058 --> 22:32.642
But still, be careful.

22:33.560 --> 22:36.730
Is it that dangerous
to take this dog into the palace?

22:37.314 --> 22:38.482
What is the big deal?

22:40.025 --> 22:40.984
It is Gwigu.

22:41.777 --> 22:43.320
He is bringing Gwigu into the palace.

22:44.654 --> 22:45.947
But Gwigu is a wily beast.

22:46.865 --> 22:48.700
How could he bring
a wily beast into the palace?

22:50.786 --> 22:54.206
Master Seo Gyeong,
who was my master long ago,

22:54.289 --> 22:57.042
used Gwigu to find evil relics
that were created with sorcery

22:57.125 --> 22:59.878
using the power of the ice stone.

22:59.961 --> 23:01.671
Yes, I have heard of it.

23:01.755 --> 23:04.716
However, I was told that it became useless

23:04.800 --> 23:06.718
after Gwigu's pottery broke.

23:06.802 --> 23:07.761
That is why

23:08.637 --> 23:12.849
I moved the spirit of Gwigu
from the pottery into a dead dog.

23:15.143 --> 23:16.686
The dog that will soon arrive

23:17.729 --> 23:18.980
is Gwigu.

23:21.900 --> 23:22.943
Gwigu?

23:27.489 --> 23:28.573
What should we do?

23:30.117 --> 23:31.952
How many of us are in the palace?

23:32.536 --> 23:33.703
There are more than ten.

23:34.287 --> 23:35.664
Did you report this to Cheonbugwan?

23:35.747 --> 23:38.625
I sent someone there,
so they will be here soon.

24:04.442 --> 24:08.822
We arranged today's meeting to make peace
between Songrim and the royal family.

24:09.489 --> 24:12.826
The Crown Prince was kind enough
to visit you and invite you over himself.

24:12.909 --> 24:14.452
But you wish to bring this wily beast

24:14.536 --> 24:16.705
into the place
without His Majesty's permission?

24:16.788 --> 24:18.790
He gave me permission to bring in the dog.

24:18.874 --> 24:20.667
And right now, Gwigu cannot go wild

24:20.750 --> 24:23.461
and cause danger
since it lives inside the body of a dog.

24:23.545 --> 24:26.673
So it cannot harm a soul shifter
even if it sees one?

24:26.756 --> 24:30.260
Instead, it will let you know by barking.

24:31.553 --> 24:32.596
Bark.

24:33.805 --> 24:34.806
Bark!

24:46.568 --> 24:48.695
Oh, my goodness!

24:52.574 --> 24:53.992
It is a soul shifter.

24:54.868 --> 24:57.954
As expected, there are
more soul shifters within the palace.

25:04.461 --> 25:05.587
What was that sound?

25:06.338 --> 25:09.549
Does this mean there is a soul shifter
inside my palace?

25:11.343 --> 25:12.385
It seems so.

25:13.094 --> 25:15.597
Then why are you just standing there?

25:15.680 --> 25:18.433
Get out there and catch the soul shifter.

25:18.516 --> 25:21.394
Like I told you earlier,
I brought the dog as a gift.

25:21.478 --> 25:24.356
I will leave it here with you.

25:24.439 --> 25:26.650
You can use it to find
or catch the soul shifters

25:26.733 --> 25:28.360
inside the palace, Your Majesty.

25:29.194 --> 25:30.987
Take it away. We do not need it.

25:31.613 --> 25:34.199
How dare you bring a wily beast
inside the palace!

25:34.282 --> 25:35.909
His Majesty already suffers from anxiety.

25:35.992 --> 25:38.870
Are you trying to harm him
with that wily beast of yours?

25:41.248 --> 25:44.876
Mother, we were the ones
who invited Master Lee to the palace.

25:44.960 --> 25:46.670
Stay out of this.

25:47.545 --> 25:51.132
The mages of Cheonbugwan
are in charge of protecting the palace.

25:51.216 --> 25:53.468
If there is anything made with sorcery
inside the palace,

25:53.551 --> 25:55.387
they will be the ones to get rid of it.

25:55.470 --> 25:58.014
I do not wish for a wily beast
living inside a dead dog

25:58.098 --> 25:59.891
and the people of Songrim to interfere.

26:00.433 --> 26:03.311
It is merely an attempt to humiliate us.

26:05.355 --> 26:07.232
You must stop them, Your Majesty.

26:35.093 --> 26:37.679
The son of Cheonbugwan's Gwanju
should be protecting the royal family,

26:37.762 --> 26:39.723
but you brought in a wily beast instead.

26:41.599 --> 26:43.685
It is Master Lee's gift for the King.

26:43.768 --> 26:45.312
Please let us in.

26:45.395 --> 26:47.731
I was told to safely bring him inside.

26:53.361 --> 26:54.362
Is that so?

26:54.446 --> 26:56.364
Then try your best to get inside.

26:56.948 --> 26:58.825
Kill the wily beast
that has trespassed the palace.

27:01.328 --> 27:04.289
If you successfully bring him in,
I shall give you a reward.

27:04.873 --> 27:07.625
Damn it.
Is this why he picked me to do this?

27:36.071 --> 27:37.697
Your Majesty, it is I, Jin Mu.

27:38.281 --> 27:40.909
I shall get rid of
these insolent men from Songrim.

27:41.451 --> 27:44.454
His Majesty has invited us here
and we are still talking.

27:44.537 --> 27:46.581
Jin Mu, this is not
your place to interfere.

27:46.664 --> 27:48.958
How dare you bring in that dog
without permission!

27:49.042 --> 27:50.668
What kind of crazy act is this?

27:50.752 --> 27:51.961
Silence.

28:08.395 --> 28:10.688
Guards! What are you doing? Stop that man!

28:15.276 --> 28:16.403
Father.

28:16.486 --> 28:18.071
You must stop both of them.

28:18.154 --> 28:20.407
If this leads to a fight,
it will end our relationship with Songrim.

28:20.990 --> 28:21.950
We must fight.

28:22.033 --> 28:24.953
Songrim has brought
a wily beast into the royal palace.

28:25.036 --> 28:26.621
It is Cheonbugwan's job to protect us.

28:27.372 --> 28:29.207
- Father!
- Your Majesty!

28:33.878 --> 28:34.963
I order all of you…

28:37.006 --> 28:38.091
to stop.

28:57.360 --> 28:58.653
Stop!

29:13.334 --> 29:14.586
Master Lee.

29:14.669 --> 29:17.464
I invited you over for a friendly meeting.
Did you have to shock me like this?

29:18.131 --> 29:19.674
I am sorry if I startled you.

29:20.633 --> 29:24.012
Your Majesty, if the ice stone
gets revealed to the world,

29:24.095 --> 29:26.556
a greater conflict will arise.

29:27.140 --> 29:28.224
The ice stone?

29:28.308 --> 29:29.976
Is it because of the soul shifters?

29:30.059 --> 29:31.644
People have occasionally used

29:31.728 --> 29:34.731
the remaining Soul Ejectors
to shift souls after the Great Chaos.

29:35.440 --> 29:39.402
Someone seems to be
making Soul Ejectors again.

29:41.321 --> 29:44.699
The ice stone has come out into the world.

29:50.872 --> 29:51.915
So what are you saying?

29:51.998 --> 29:54.167
Where is it? In whose hands?

29:54.959 --> 29:56.711
Probably in the hands of those

29:56.795 --> 30:00.298
who sent Naksu here and turned
a Songrim mage into a soul shifter.

30:00.882 --> 30:02.550
I was told that Master Seo Gyeong

30:02.634 --> 30:04.928
destroyed all the ice stones 200 years ago
after the Great Chaos.

30:05.011 --> 30:05.929
However,

30:06.012 --> 30:09.933
I guess not all were destroyed
and instead left in Songrim.

30:10.016 --> 30:13.561
It is not easy to quell human desires.

30:13.645 --> 30:14.687
However,

30:16.022 --> 30:17.732
the return of the ice stone

30:17.816 --> 30:21.069
also implies the return
of a great man like Master Seo Gyeong.

30:24.280 --> 30:27.325
Master Seo Gyeong was born
with the energy of the King's Star.

30:27.909 --> 30:30.036
However, he did not become the king.

30:31.746 --> 30:33.122
Are you saying there could be

30:33.915 --> 30:36.376
another person born with the energy
of the King's Star?

30:41.214 --> 30:43.633
Even if he exists,
the light he emits will be faint.

30:43.716 --> 30:47.929
And the energy of the seven stars
surrounding him will not show yet.

30:49.013 --> 30:51.224
A power strong enough
to defy the laws of nature

30:51.307 --> 30:55.186
and bring chaos to the world
has returned once again.

30:55.270 --> 30:57.355
Thus, someone strong enough
to stop it should also appear.

30:58.231 --> 30:59.315
That way,

31:00.608 --> 31:03.653
the world will be able
to maintain balance.

31:09.659 --> 31:14.414
What I am trying to say is that
there is no need to feel so anxious.

31:15.874 --> 31:19.460
I hope this helps you calm your anxiety.

31:24.716 --> 31:27.093
Thank you for your words of comfort.

31:27.927 --> 31:30.513
Then I should leave now.

31:31.222 --> 31:33.558
As you refused to accept my gift,

31:33.641 --> 31:36.352
I will take Gwigu back with me.

31:38.062 --> 31:40.064
- Your Majesty.
- Do as you please.

31:59.417 --> 32:01.544
No, wait. Stop.

32:02.378 --> 32:04.213
Are we leaving?

32:04.297 --> 32:05.840
I saw everything that I needed to see.

32:08.301 --> 32:11.012
Does this mean there is a soul shifter
inside my palace?

32:11.512 --> 32:13.139
Take it away. We do not need it.

32:13.222 --> 32:15.808
How dare you bring a wily beast
inside the palace!

32:17.185 --> 32:18.937
They revealed themselves
after I instilled fear.

32:22.607 --> 32:24.317
You must have been startled.

32:24.400 --> 32:25.985
Are you all right?

32:26.069 --> 32:27.862
How did you get hurt?

32:29.072 --> 32:32.033
The dog did not get hurt.
But thanks to you, I did.

32:33.785 --> 32:34.827
Did you get hurt?

32:35.495 --> 32:37.997
I cannot believe you got hurt
fighting those goons.

32:38.081 --> 32:39.874
He still has a long way to go, right?

32:42.251 --> 32:44.045
Wait. I see blood. Are you hurt?

32:44.879 --> 32:46.047
That is my blood.

32:46.130 --> 32:47.423
He did not get hurt at all…

32:48.132 --> 32:50.176
- Wait, blood…
- You are bleeding.

32:50.843 --> 32:52.762
Thank goodness.

32:58.184 --> 32:59.477
Does it hurt?

33:01.270 --> 33:02.438
I guess it does.

33:03.064 --> 33:05.400
It hurts. My gosh.

33:14.951 --> 33:17.120
That Gwigu belongs to Master Lee.

33:17.620 --> 33:20.540
How much does he know about Mu-deok?

33:21.541 --> 33:23.501
And what will Uk do

33:23.584 --> 33:25.378
if he finds out about Naksu?

33:34.053 --> 33:35.096
Are you all right?

33:36.597 --> 33:37.724
You are hurt all over.

33:37.807 --> 33:39.559
I am fine.

33:39.642 --> 33:42.353
Did you find the soul shifters?
What about the ice stone?

33:43.521 --> 33:44.981
You have no idea.

33:45.690 --> 33:48.026
My soul almost shifted
because of the chaos.

33:48.609 --> 33:51.112
So you caused a scene
but failed to find anyone?

33:51.195 --> 33:54.615
You should have at least
let the dog bite someone.

33:55.241 --> 33:56.325
Uk.

33:56.409 --> 33:58.578
Finding a soul shifter in the royal palace

33:58.661 --> 34:00.997
is different from finding one
in Songrim or Cheonbugwan.

34:02.206 --> 34:03.708
If things get out of hand,

34:03.791 --> 34:06.294
it will turn into a fight
between Songrim and the royal family.

34:09.422 --> 34:10.381
Let us go.

34:10.465 --> 34:11.799
You should get treated.

34:12.508 --> 34:13.509
Master Lee.

34:17.055 --> 34:19.057
Please wait here for a bit.

34:19.140 --> 34:22.226
The Crown Prince has asked me
to escort you to his palace.

34:22.810 --> 34:25.104
- The Crown Prince?
- It will rain soon.

34:25.188 --> 34:27.565
He wants you to stay until the rain stops.

34:29.817 --> 34:30.902
Let us go then.

34:39.744 --> 34:42.497
Uk, you need to take him back first.

34:42.580 --> 34:44.082
Take him to Songrim.

34:45.249 --> 34:46.417
Come here.

34:47.835 --> 34:48.961
Come on.

35:01.182 --> 35:04.811
You should have told me
before the people of Songrim arrived!

35:04.894 --> 35:06.062
I thought it was just

35:06.813 --> 35:08.523
going to be a simple meeting.

35:09.023 --> 35:10.066
If the Queen is put in danger,

35:10.149 --> 35:12.527
you will also get petrified
just like Eunuch Kim.

35:12.610 --> 35:14.320
You useless imbecile!

35:26.457 --> 35:28.543
Someone born with the energy
of the King's Star

35:28.626 --> 35:30.920
who will follow the footsteps
of Master Seo Gyeong?

35:33.256 --> 35:35.842
If it is revealed that King's Star
was created by sorcery,

35:36.801 --> 35:38.719
it will spell the end of Songrim.

35:42.682 --> 35:45.977
I sent back Gwigu to Songrim.

35:47.061 --> 35:49.105
I apologize for startling you.

35:49.188 --> 35:51.440
After a soul shifter was found in Songrim,

35:51.524 --> 35:53.901
I figured there could be one
in the palace as well.

35:54.944 --> 35:58.156
Last time, a soul shifter even tried
to enter the royal palace.

35:58.906 --> 36:01.033
I heard the person who created

36:01.117 --> 36:02.869
and killed the soul shifter was Naksu.

36:07.290 --> 36:08.374
Naksu?

36:10.251 --> 36:13.087
The female assassin
who killed many skilled fighters.

36:13.754 --> 36:15.590
Heads fell to the ground
wherever she went,

36:15.673 --> 36:17.550
which is why she was called Naksu.

36:17.633 --> 36:21.220
There are rumors that
she shifted souls and is still alive.

36:24.432 --> 36:26.058
Naksu, a soul shifter?

36:27.643 --> 36:29.395
What an interesting rumor.

37:03.638 --> 37:07.266
I hope Mu-deok gets caught
before Young Master Jang returns.

37:10.478 --> 37:11.395
Oh, my goodness!

37:14.523 --> 37:16.192
Mu-deok…

37:18.486 --> 37:19.862
Why are you shaking?

37:20.488 --> 37:22.823
Do you really believe
that I killed someone?

37:24.825 --> 37:26.827
Come inside.

37:32.250 --> 37:33.709
Why did you come here?

37:34.669 --> 37:36.003
To pack your things and run?

37:36.087 --> 37:38.130
I came to ask you for a favor.

37:38.714 --> 37:40.925
The leader of Songrim asked me
to bring you in if I ever saw you.

37:41.926 --> 37:43.094
Mu-deok.

37:43.177 --> 37:44.470
It was not you, was it?

37:45.179 --> 37:48.015
- It was not me.
- Then why did you run away?

37:48.683 --> 37:50.101
The situation made me do so.

37:51.477 --> 37:52.770
Mu-deok.

37:53.521 --> 37:54.605
Do you have

37:55.523 --> 37:57.400
some big secret you are hiding?

38:02.905 --> 38:04.240
Does Young Master Jang

38:05.324 --> 38:07.034
also know about your secret?

38:13.040 --> 38:16.627
Mu-deok, I want you to run away.

38:17.211 --> 38:18.296
I will give you enough money.

38:18.379 --> 38:19.964
Run away and never come back.

38:20.047 --> 38:21.173
I cannot do that.

38:22.383 --> 38:24.719
I cannot leave Young Master Jang.

38:24.802 --> 38:26.053
Why not?

38:27.305 --> 38:30.433
Young Master Jang will only fall
under suspicion if you stay by his side.

38:30.516 --> 38:31.851
If you are worried about him,

38:32.643 --> 38:34.103
you must help me.

38:34.186 --> 38:37.106
You refuse to talk to Songrim's leader
or run away.

38:37.690 --> 38:39.025
What do you plan to do?

38:40.693 --> 38:42.528
I must find the real assassin.

38:43.988 --> 38:48.367
That assassin is going around
killing everyone that knows them.

38:53.414 --> 38:55.458
Is this where Cheonbugwan's Gwanju lives?

38:56.292 --> 38:58.169
It must be a very prestigious family.

39:00.129 --> 39:03.424
Does someone from the Jang family
also know you?

39:06.135 --> 39:09.347
Wait over there by the corner.
I will bring that person to you.

39:20.149 --> 39:22.318
I am going to ask someone to testify

39:22.401 --> 39:25.988
that I was not in the room
when those people were killed at the inn.

39:27.365 --> 39:28.657
Who are you going to ask?

39:29.241 --> 39:30.618
Young Lady Jin from Jinyowon.

39:31.619 --> 39:33.204
I ran into her at the inn.

39:34.205 --> 39:36.374
That catty young lady will not
agree to see you.

39:37.625 --> 39:38.834
Maidservant Kim.

39:39.960 --> 39:42.213
I want you to take me to Jinyowon.

39:44.423 --> 39:45.424
Jinyowon?

40:10.032 --> 40:13.452
I am sorry.
Could you pick up the cane for me?

40:19.917 --> 40:20.876
Thank you.

40:21.752 --> 40:24.296
Can you tell me where I am right now?

40:25.047 --> 40:29.009
This is the house of Master Jang,
the Gwanju of Cheonbugwan.

40:30.803 --> 40:31.971
I see.

40:33.013 --> 40:34.098
Thank you.

40:47.361 --> 40:48.612
Mu-deok.

40:48.696 --> 40:49.738
Let us go.

40:57.538 --> 40:59.498
I guess Mu-deok really can see now.

41:00.124 --> 41:02.084
But she did not recognize me.

41:02.877 --> 41:04.545
I wonder if that is a good thing.

41:08.174 --> 41:09.425
Why are you alone?

41:10.217 --> 41:13.137
I was mistaken.
It turns out I did not know her at all.

41:14.555 --> 41:16.974
It is all over now.
Let us return to Cheonbugwan.

41:29.153 --> 41:30.696
Can I try it?

41:30.779 --> 41:31.655
- No.
- No.

41:31.739 --> 41:33.866
Come on. Stop it.

41:33.949 --> 41:35.868
I am getting all wet.

41:35.951 --> 41:37.578
It is that umbrella.

41:38.204 --> 41:39.121
This is an umbrella.

41:40.080 --> 41:41.957
You can use this as a cane.

41:44.960 --> 41:47.505
Stop it. My mom will scold me.

41:47.588 --> 41:48.506
Stop it already!

41:49.173 --> 41:51.425
- No way.
- Hey, kid.

41:52.718 --> 41:55.721
Would you like
to switch umbrellas with me?

41:59.600 --> 42:03.896
I heard Naksu shifted her soul

42:03.979 --> 42:07.733
into the body of
a tall, well-built young man.

42:07.816 --> 42:11.320
She could have shifted her soul
into the body of a short, petite woman.

42:13.405 --> 42:18.035
If she entered such a weak body,
there would be no need to discard her.

42:20.913 --> 42:22.039
No, I am telling you.

42:22.581 --> 42:24.792
Naksu in Blue was clearly a man.

42:25.584 --> 42:27.002
"Naksu in Blue."

42:27.086 --> 42:30.464
- I have also heard of that nickname.
- He covered himself with a blue cloth.

42:30.548 --> 42:34.635
It became such a trend
that everyone was wearing blue cloth.

42:34.718 --> 42:37.096
People wore blue cloths
because they thought

42:37.179 --> 42:40.224
Naksu in Blue would protect them
from the alchemy of souls.

42:41.934 --> 42:43.727
Naksu may have been an assassin,

42:45.229 --> 42:48.148
but she never hurt ordinary people
and was very strong.

42:53.779 --> 42:56.657
People can be very foolish.

42:56.740 --> 42:58.325
They are not foolish.

42:59.201 --> 43:00.452
They are frightened.

43:03.205 --> 43:05.791
Naksu's body was burned,
and they all know that

43:06.667 --> 43:09.461
it was done by those
with power and authority.

43:11.255 --> 43:12.715
Calling them fools

43:13.674 --> 43:15.843
when they are actually scared
is negligence.

43:25.102 --> 43:28.731
I gathered this meeting
hoping to think of a solution,

43:28.814 --> 43:32.026
but you are arrogant enough
to just sit there and criticize me.

43:35.279 --> 43:38.991
I understand that
you two wish to disparage each other,

43:39.074 --> 43:42.244
but I wish for all of us
to get along amicably.

43:43.162 --> 43:45.414
Master Lee is also here with us.

43:45.497 --> 43:46.665
Let us drink our tea.

43:49.752 --> 43:51.045
Your Royal Highness.

43:52.046 --> 43:53.380
What is it?

43:56.800 --> 43:59.553
Young Lady Heo wishes to come inside.

43:59.637 --> 44:00.638
Let her in.

44:09.146 --> 44:10.439
What brings you here?

44:10.522 --> 44:12.983
I heard someone was injured
after getting into a fight.

44:13.567 --> 44:15.194
I came to take a look.

44:17.321 --> 44:19.615
There is only one person who got hurt.

44:19.698 --> 44:22.576
- Take him out and treat his wound.
- I am all right.

44:22.660 --> 44:24.161
It will not take long.

44:24.244 --> 44:25.454
Please come with me.

44:37.841 --> 44:40.511
It seems like Uk will get engaged again.

44:40.594 --> 44:41.637
How many times is this?

44:41.720 --> 44:43.722
- What do you mean?
- Did you not know?

44:43.806 --> 44:46.016
You really know nothing, do you?

44:46.100 --> 44:48.102
Rumor has already spread in Sejukwon.

44:48.185 --> 44:51.897
You three are the top potential candidates
to become Heo Yeom's grandson-in-law.

44:52.481 --> 44:54.149
Uk is the third on his list.

44:54.233 --> 44:56.068
But I guess to her, he is the first.

44:57.027 --> 44:58.987
Heo Yeom wishes to marry her off
within this year.

44:59.071 --> 45:01.782
There will soon be talks of engagement.
I promise you.

45:07.871 --> 45:11.792
The cut is not too deep.
This pill can help stop the bleeding.

45:11.875 --> 45:14.711
Then you could have just
given it to me earlier.

45:14.795 --> 45:16.630
I heard you were hurt.

45:16.713 --> 45:21.093
I wanted to see for myself
so I could feel at ease.

45:23.804 --> 45:24.888
Well…

45:25.556 --> 45:29.893
You already got hurt from the many duels,
so I was concerned.

45:31.019 --> 45:32.271
I am fine.

45:32.980 --> 45:34.231
All right.

45:40.446 --> 45:44.533
Oh, right. Maidservant Kim
gave this to me as a gift.

45:44.616 --> 45:47.244
I have not yet been able to thank you.

45:49.037 --> 45:50.330
It looks exactly the same.

45:55.627 --> 45:56.628
What do you mean?

45:58.630 --> 46:00.966
It is exactly the same
as the one I have seen for 20 years.

46:01.592 --> 46:03.635
Is it a valuable item?

46:08.348 --> 46:09.808
It looks new.

46:09.892 --> 46:11.894
So it probably is not ours.

46:12.686 --> 46:14.521
They made it look so similar.

46:15.856 --> 46:16.690
Goodness.

46:17.357 --> 46:19.318
The Crown Prince might be right.

46:20.444 --> 46:22.613
Uk really might get engaged soon.

46:22.696 --> 46:24.656
But to Master Heo,
he is the third in line.

46:26.992 --> 46:29.328
Then do you plan to marry her
since you are the first in line?

46:30.370 --> 46:33.415
If you get married,
you will have to return to Seoho Fortress.

46:33.999 --> 46:37.002
Yul, do not get married.
I will feel lonely without you.

46:38.629 --> 46:40.923
I can recognize soul shifters.

46:49.515 --> 46:52.059
I must take them to Seoho Fortress
as soon as possible.

46:52.142 --> 46:53.185
Who?

46:54.061 --> 46:54.937
Me?

47:01.109 --> 47:02.444
I take that back.

47:03.153 --> 47:07.741
I feel very much at ease
after having seen how you reacted today.

47:08.325 --> 47:09.952
I am relieved to hear that.

47:10.869 --> 47:12.913
What is that you wish
to ask me for in private?

47:15.082 --> 47:17.668
I know you took Naksu's sword,

47:17.751 --> 47:19.753
but would it be possible
to give that to me?

47:28.428 --> 47:31.640
I did watch the magic show last year.

47:32.224 --> 47:33.475
I even saw elephants.

47:33.976 --> 47:37.187
But I should act like it is my first time
when I go with Young Master Park, right?

47:37.271 --> 47:39.815
So you got those tickets
for you and Young Master Park.

47:39.898 --> 47:42.067
You startled me. What are you doing here?

47:42.150 --> 47:44.695
I came to ask you for a favor.

47:44.778 --> 47:45.904
A favor?

47:46.947 --> 47:48.323
Do not bother.

47:48.407 --> 47:51.493
I have no intentions of helping you.

47:51.577 --> 47:53.203
I am being framed for murder.

47:53.954 --> 47:55.080
What?

47:55.163 --> 47:57.416
Can you please tell the leader of Songrim

47:58.125 --> 48:00.544
that you saw me earlier at the inn?

48:01.670 --> 48:05.924
You want me to go to Songrim
and tell him that I had set foot

48:06.508 --> 48:07.759
at a place like that?

48:08.468 --> 48:10.304
I would be mad to do that.

48:12.180 --> 48:13.807
You are my only hope.

48:14.474 --> 48:16.351
I beg of you to help.

48:19.438 --> 48:20.606
No.

48:20.689 --> 48:22.608
I told Young Master Park
that I had an extra ticket.

48:22.691 --> 48:24.568
I do not want to reveal
I bought them from a scalper.

48:24.651 --> 48:27.279
Your embarrassment will only be temporary,

48:27.362 --> 48:29.364
but I could really get killed for this.

48:30.365 --> 48:32.409
If my mother finds out, she will kill me.

48:32.492 --> 48:35.245
There is no way
she would kill her own daughter!

48:35.329 --> 48:37.539
Why are you yelling?
You came to ask for a favor.

48:40.292 --> 48:43.587
Then I guess I have no choice
but to tell your mother what happened

48:44.087 --> 48:45.714
and ask her to help me instead.

48:45.797 --> 48:47.424
You are going to ask my mother?

48:48.842 --> 48:50.385
There she is.

48:52.763 --> 48:55.807
You did not need to bring gifts
to apologize for the past.

48:57.100 --> 49:00.771
The more I thought about it,
the more apologetic I felt.

49:02.189 --> 49:04.733
I will go and ask her myself.

49:04.816 --> 49:05.734
Wait.

49:05.817 --> 49:08.904
I will think about it. Come with me first.

49:17.746 --> 49:19.790
I will be right back. Stay here.

49:20.374 --> 49:21.833
If you do not come, I will yell.

49:21.917 --> 49:23.418
- I will be back.
- Cho-yeon.

49:24.211 --> 49:25.337
Yes, Mother.

49:26.129 --> 49:26.963
Wait here.

49:58.286 --> 49:59.663
She is a young girl.

50:00.997 --> 50:02.165
I wonder who she is.

50:31.611 --> 50:33.238
Is it because of the incense stick?

50:37.242 --> 50:38.535
What a nice vase.

50:39.578 --> 50:43.540
If you put flowers in the vase,
it helps them emit a stronger scent.

50:44.791 --> 50:46.710
- Really?
- Yes.

50:46.793 --> 50:50.005
I have been wanting to change
the vase in my daughter's room.

50:51.047 --> 50:51.965
Thank you.

50:55.677 --> 50:58.722
Mother, are you going to put the vase
in Bu-yeon's room?

50:58.805 --> 51:00.724
It helps the flowers emit
a stronger scent.

51:00.807 --> 51:04.478
Your sister cannot see, so she should
at least enjoy the scent of the flowers.

51:48.772 --> 51:50.106
How dare you touch that!

51:50.190 --> 51:52.025
What are you doing in my daughter's room?

51:56.905 --> 51:58.323
She came with me.

51:58.406 --> 51:59.866
She must have gotten lost.

52:00.450 --> 52:02.702
Mu-deok, what were you doing here?

52:04.996 --> 52:06.164
I am sorry.

52:07.958 --> 52:10.126
Please help me, just this once.

52:11.461 --> 52:13.046
Please leave.

52:13.129 --> 52:14.965
You are not allowed in here.

52:15.048 --> 52:16.758
All right. Let us leave.

52:20.345 --> 52:22.180
I promise I will go.

52:24.641 --> 52:25.725
Cho-yeon.

52:26.393 --> 52:29.980
Tell the servants
to clean Bu-yeon's room again.

52:30.730 --> 52:32.524
Yes, Mother.

53:00.260 --> 53:01.261
So-i.

53:02.262 --> 53:04.055
This man will be your father.

53:05.015 --> 53:06.141
My father?

53:07.058 --> 53:09.477
A father is willing to take in
a fake daughter?

53:12.856 --> 53:16.484
I am not the father of Jin Bu-yeon.

53:17.986 --> 53:21.031
Jin Bu-yeon's biological father
is someone else.

53:33.668 --> 53:36.379
To be acknowledged
as the daughter of the Jin family,

53:36.463 --> 53:38.340
you must open the door to Jinyowon.

53:38.423 --> 53:41.843
And to do that, the blood
of the Jin family needs to run inside you.

53:45.722 --> 53:47.057
What is that?

53:47.140 --> 53:50.477
A worm that sucked the blood
of a female member of the Jin family.

54:12.457 --> 54:14.376
That is the blood of Cho-yeon,

54:15.377 --> 54:16.920
my beloved daughter.

54:18.797 --> 54:20.966
What do you plan to do with that?

54:21.049 --> 54:22.467
Give me your hand.

54:24.636 --> 54:26.221
I said, give me your hand.

55:09.681 --> 55:12.851
You now have the blood of the Jin family
running inside you.

55:13.935 --> 55:16.354
If I do not use sorcery to keep it alive,

55:16.438 --> 55:19.315
that worm will start eating you
from the inside.

55:20.650 --> 55:22.235
If you try to run from me,

55:23.069 --> 55:25.363
that worm will eat you alive.

55:32.454 --> 55:35.123
That room belonged to her daughter
who died ten years ago.

55:36.291 --> 55:37.876
She apparently drowned and died,

55:38.626 --> 55:41.171
but Lady Jin still thinks
she might come back.

55:42.756 --> 55:43.965
She is a pitiful woman,

55:44.924 --> 55:46.593
so forgive her for slapping you.

55:49.721 --> 55:52.766
By any chance, was that daughter blind?

55:53.683 --> 55:55.977
Yes, she was.

55:57.270 --> 55:59.481
The owner of this body
used to be blind as well.

56:00.273 --> 56:02.609
Could that be why
I suddenly felt something earlier?

56:20.085 --> 56:23.213
Master Lee wanted to talk
to the Crown Prince in private.

56:23.838 --> 56:24.839
I see.

56:30.011 --> 56:32.972
The leader has asked us
to escort you to Songrim.

56:33.556 --> 56:35.558
Just me? Why?

56:35.642 --> 56:36.643
Come with us.

56:47.153 --> 56:48.738
Am I getting locked in here again?

56:49.239 --> 56:51.074
- What is going on?
- It is--

56:51.783 --> 56:53.118
We were told to stay silent.

56:53.910 --> 56:55.120
Wait here until he comes.

57:04.838 --> 57:08.091
Mu-deok was found near the bodies,
so I get why she was taken away.

57:08.174 --> 57:10.677
But why Young Master Jang?
He was at the palace.

57:12.053 --> 57:14.597
What is the leader of Songrim thinking?

57:14.681 --> 57:15.682
I do not know either.

57:18.309 --> 57:19.352
Yul.

57:19.435 --> 57:21.563
Mu-deok would never kill anyone.

57:22.188 --> 57:23.273
Right?

57:26.359 --> 57:28.528
May I take a look at the bodies?

57:41.416 --> 57:43.293
It was done by a skilled swordsman.

57:43.918 --> 57:45.545
It could not have been Mu-deok.

57:47.172 --> 57:48.756
But she is the assassin, Naksu.

57:49.716 --> 57:51.468
She could have killed those men.

57:56.639 --> 57:59.559
I have a good reason for doing this,

57:59.642 --> 58:01.060
so just go on your way.

58:04.647 --> 58:07.484
- They are those thugs.
- Do you know them?

58:09.777 --> 58:12.030
I got into a fight with them
some time ago.

58:17.285 --> 58:19.829
Can I take their bodies now
and hold a funeral for them?

58:26.377 --> 58:28.505
What brings the owner of Chwiseonru here?

58:28.588 --> 58:30.089
Did someone die?

58:30.173 --> 58:32.634
Our guards got killed.

58:45.939 --> 58:47.315
Young Master Park.

58:47.398 --> 58:49.317
Maidservant Kim told me what happened.

58:51.236 --> 58:52.612
Young Lady Jin.

58:53.613 --> 58:55.240
Please help Mu-deok.

59:03.122 --> 59:05.875
I went to the inn
to buy tickets from scalpers.

59:07.710 --> 59:09.587
And I saw Mu-deok there.

59:11.673 --> 59:12.715
But of course,

59:12.799 --> 59:16.594
it was my first time
going to such a place.

59:17.178 --> 59:18.263
I know.

59:19.097 --> 59:22.850
We talked for a bit,
and right after Mu-deok went inside,

59:22.934 --> 59:24.894
I saw you coming in, my lord.

59:25.812 --> 59:30.275
And of course,
I never thought I would meet you there.

59:31.943 --> 59:33.111
I know.

59:36.573 --> 59:37.991
Judging by the circumstances,

59:39.033 --> 59:43.121
there is no way Mu-deok had enough time
to kill all those men.

59:44.163 --> 59:47.375
A girl recently came
to Chwiseonru and looked for Mu-deok,

59:47.458 --> 59:48.918
pretending to be a mage.

59:49.002 --> 59:50.503
The owner of Chwiseonru thinks

59:50.587 --> 59:54.549
it might have been So-i,
the girl that the broker warned her about.

59:54.632 --> 59:57.010
I once saw a girl
arguing with those thugs.

59:58.344 --> 59:59.596
The dead broker,

59:59.679 --> 01:00:00.972
thugs, and guards.

01:00:01.848 --> 01:00:04.100
They all had something to do
with that girl, So-i.

01:00:04.183 --> 01:00:06.019
That swindler, So-i, seems suspicious.

01:00:06.894 --> 01:00:09.147
In any case, it means Mu-deok is innocent.

01:00:10.690 --> 01:00:11.733
All right.

01:00:12.734 --> 01:00:17.322
I also did not think that
Mu-deok would have committed murder.

01:00:17.405 --> 01:00:21.534
I knew it. You knew that Mu-deok would
never do such a thing, right?

01:00:21.618 --> 01:00:25.163
Then can you release Uk and Mu-deok now?

01:00:25.246 --> 01:00:27.498
The reason I locked both of them up

01:00:28.374 --> 01:00:30.335
was to ask them about something else.

01:00:31.377 --> 01:00:32.879
I will take care of it from here.

01:00:32.962 --> 01:00:34.088
You may all leave.

01:00:34.172 --> 01:00:35.340
All right.

01:00:54.275 --> 01:00:55.526
My lord.

01:00:56.277 --> 01:00:58.905
What is this?
At least tell me what is going on.

01:00:59.697 --> 01:01:02.158
Mu-deok committed murder.

01:01:05.286 --> 01:01:06.287
What--

01:01:06.371 --> 01:01:09.457
She killed those who knew about her past.

01:01:12.627 --> 01:01:16.673
Tell me what it is that you and Mu-deok
are hiding from me.

01:01:17.840 --> 01:01:20.301
If your statement
does not match Mu-deok's,

01:01:20.885 --> 01:01:23.221
you will not be able
to leave this Secret Room.

01:01:24.055 --> 01:01:25.807
And Mu-deok will die.

01:01:47.120 --> 01:01:48.663
My lord, hear me out--

01:01:48.746 --> 01:01:50.081
This is not about the murders.

01:01:52.041 --> 01:01:54.001
Uk has told me your secret.

01:01:55.294 --> 01:01:56.546
He told me everything.

01:02:00.133 --> 01:02:04.053
If you also tell me the truth,
I shall spare your life.

01:02:05.179 --> 01:02:06.347
However,

01:02:06.431 --> 01:02:09.517
if anything that you say
differs from what he said,

01:02:11.436 --> 01:02:12.895
you will die.

01:02:21.821 --> 01:02:23.698
If he found out she was a soul shifter,

01:02:23.781 --> 01:02:25.742
he would not waste time like this.

01:02:25.825 --> 01:02:28.411
He is trying to test us
by interrogating us separately.

01:02:29.245 --> 01:02:31.581
We have to say the same thing.

01:02:33.374 --> 01:02:36.627
What would Uk have said
to the same question?

01:02:36.711 --> 01:02:40.548
A secret that ensures
that we say the same thing.

01:02:40.631 --> 01:02:45.219
A secret that is private
but will not get me killed if revealed.

01:02:48.306 --> 01:02:49.766
I will tell you the truth.

01:02:49.849 --> 01:02:51.225
I will tell you my secret.

01:02:58.900 --> 01:03:00.359
What happened?

01:03:01.360 --> 01:03:03.321
Both Mu-deok and Uk

01:03:04.197 --> 01:03:05.323
can be set free.

01:03:05.823 --> 01:03:08.868
What did they say?
Did they say the same thing?

01:03:12.079 --> 01:03:15.082
They both did say the same thing.

01:03:44.570 --> 01:03:47.448
- You got out.
- So did you.

01:03:48.032 --> 01:03:50.910
- I am relieved that you are all right.
- Yes, me too.

01:03:50.993 --> 01:03:52.829
Thank goodness we said the same thing.

01:03:54.372 --> 01:03:55.873
What did you say?

01:03:55.957 --> 01:03:57.667
The fact that we both got out…

01:03:59.043 --> 01:04:01.045
means you said
the same thing as what I said.

01:04:06.008 --> 01:04:09.470
You separately locked them up
to find out what they were hiding.

01:04:09.554 --> 01:04:11.472
I guess you got something out of them.

01:04:11.556 --> 01:04:12.390
Tell me.

01:04:12.473 --> 01:04:14.851
What was the secret they were hiding?

01:04:15.768 --> 01:04:17.186
The two of them…

01:04:18.271 --> 01:04:21.732
told me a secret
that completely shut me up.

01:04:24.569 --> 01:04:27.196
They both showed me the same thing.

01:04:29.115 --> 01:04:30.491
I will tell you the truth.

01:04:31.409 --> 01:04:33.035
I tried not to let it show.

01:04:34.287 --> 01:04:36.080
This is what I kept inside.

01:04:53.723 --> 01:04:55.224
You see, I…

01:04:55.725 --> 01:04:58.102
I actually…

01:05:05.067 --> 01:05:06.694
I like Mu-deok a lot.

01:05:10.531 --> 01:05:12.366
I like Young Master Jang very much.

01:05:18.748 --> 01:05:21.208
I figured it would ensure
that we said the same thing.

01:05:23.044 --> 01:05:25.421
It was not crucial enough
to get me killed.

01:05:25.504 --> 01:05:29.258
Right. Songrim's Book of Regulations
does not state anything about

01:05:29.342 --> 01:05:31.719
punishing young men and women
for falling in love.

01:05:34.889 --> 01:05:35.723
Exactly.

01:05:35.806 --> 01:05:39.852
They would not kill a maid
for loving her owner to death.

01:05:41.938 --> 01:05:45.232
You said that?
You told him that you loved me to death?

01:05:46.984 --> 01:05:48.110
Well…

01:05:48.819 --> 01:05:52.031
I just exaggerated
because I had to convince him.

01:05:55.284 --> 01:05:56.827
I had no choice but to say it.

01:05:58.204 --> 01:06:01.707
You had no choice but to admit
that you loved me to death.

01:06:02.917 --> 01:06:04.627
Gosh, I feel so bad.

01:06:05.336 --> 01:06:07.713
I was not as passionate
when I expressed my feelings.

01:06:08.255 --> 01:06:09.548
I guess I should try harder.

01:06:09.632 --> 01:06:10.800
Forget it.

01:06:12.593 --> 01:06:16.597
Do not put everything on the line
for something as fickle as love.

01:06:17.932 --> 01:06:19.850
If something like this ever happens again,

01:06:20.601 --> 01:06:22.895
and you find yourself
in a life or death situation,

01:06:23.980 --> 01:06:25.231
give up on love…

01:06:26.524 --> 01:06:27.733
and choose your life.

01:06:30.111 --> 01:06:31.737
Do that if you do not wish to die.

01:06:32.655 --> 01:06:34.198
That is an order from your master.

01:06:39.245 --> 01:06:40.371
Master.

01:06:41.080 --> 01:06:42.623
What if I do not mind dying?

01:06:43.416 --> 01:06:45.835
Then can I hold onto it
and keep loving you?

01:06:48.295 --> 01:06:50.423
I told you that
I am willing to risk it all

01:06:51.382 --> 01:06:53.175
and that we are in this together.

01:06:54.552 --> 01:06:56.178
I will keep going no matter what.

01:06:56.721 --> 01:07:01.183
So you should do the same
and stick to your confession.

01:07:02.727 --> 01:07:04.311
Keep loving me to death.

01:07:43.809 --> 01:07:47.730
If Uk falls in love
with a woman he should not,

01:07:47.813 --> 01:07:49.231
what would you do?

01:07:49.315 --> 01:07:53.277
If I am to stay in love with you,
I need to be certain you are mine.

01:07:53.360 --> 01:07:55.237
How dare you disgrace Jinyowon?

01:07:55.988 --> 01:07:57.031
- This is too salty!
- They are perfect for each other.

01:07:57.114 --> 01:07:58.407
Why call off the wedding?

01:07:58.491 --> 01:08:00.242
I am looking for Shaman Choi.

01:08:00.326 --> 01:08:03.162
If Shaman Choi was hunted by
the mages of Cheonbugwan,

01:08:03.245 --> 01:08:06.082
are you seeking her because
she bears a grudge against your father?

01:08:06.165 --> 01:08:08.876
If he comes, let me know immediately.

01:08:08.959 --> 01:08:10.544
Even though it is dead, it is still Gwigu.

01:08:10.628 --> 01:08:12.505
You are feigning ignorance, right?

01:08:13.172 --> 01:08:15.758
It must be tough for you.

01:08:15.841 --> 01:08:18.177
If you must draw
and point that sword at someone,

01:08:18.260 --> 01:08:20.554
point it at me before at anyone else.

01:08:22.765 --> 01:08:27.770
Subtitle translation by: Ja-won Lee
